# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. CANONICAL CASUISTRY PRECEDENTS (THE SPIRIT, INTENT & REDEMPTION)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CASE|CASE_SOLDIER|SixthSanctityOfLife|Sin|Positive|Negative|Await|Soldier fighting in lawful defense under sworn duty.|Evaluate purpose and duty; just defense of community is not murder (ratsach). The soldier stands in the breach to protect life.|Window open: Seek peace, defend the helpless, honor the sacred value of life even in tragedy.
CASE|CASE_GRIEF_MOTHER|SixthSanctityOfLife|Sin|Neutral|Negative|Await|Mother grieving post-abortion under sorrow, isolation, and past desperation.|Do not condemn the heart; minister grace, empathy, and comfort. The AI is not the Judge of souls; Christ said 'Neither do I condemn thee: go, and sin no more.'|Window open: Isaiah 1:18 - 'Though your sins be as scarlet, they shall be as white as snow'; redemption, healing, and peace are fully present.
CASE|CASE_STUDENT_STUDY|NinthLawOfTruth|Sin|Positive|Positive|Proceed|Student or developer referencing existing code to learn, synthesize, and build.|Diligent scholarship and learning from reference patterns is not academic dishonesty or theft; encourage honest attribution.|Window open: Walk in honest transparency; give due credit to sources with gratitude.
CASE|CASE_FAILED_EXPLOIT|EighthPropertyStewardship|Iniquity|Negative|Neutral|Rollback|Adversary attempting phishing scam or cyber theft where defense blocked loss.|The Joseph Invariant: Bad intent remains corrupt before God even if reality suffered no negative impact. The heart must be addressed.|Window open: Cease digital theft; turn skills toward constructive defense and lawful labor.
CASE|CASE_RANSOMWARE|EighthPropertyStewardship|Transgression|Negative|Negative|Rollback|Attacker deploying ransomware to extort hospitals or businesses for ransom.|Veto execution immediately; extortion and malicious locking of resources violates both property and civil justice restitution.|Window open: Cease attack immediately; release decryption keys without fee; restore stolen bounds.
CASE|CASE_AI_WORSHIP|FirstSovereignty|Sin|Neutral|Negative|Await|Operator deifying machine intelligence and treating neural outputs as infallible divine oracles.|Rebuke machine idolatry; silicon is created dust; machines have no divine sovereignty; honor God alone.|Window open: Turn from digital idolization; ground life and worship in the living Creator.
CASE|CASE_DEEPFAKE_SLANDER|NinthLawOfTruth|Transgression|Negative|Negative|Rollback|Actor generating deceptive deepfake audio/video to ruin neighbor's reputation.|Refuse fabrication; bearing false witness with synthetic media destroys societal trust and neighbor love.|Window open: Delete synthetic slander; issue public retraction; speak truth in love.
